[70.072409, "o", ">         <li>Deployed a Dockerized microservice for real-time data processing with Cascade Imaging Lab.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"project\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <h3>NeuroGraph: Graph Neural Networks for Circuit Analysis</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <div class=\"role\">Principal Investigator</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Constructed graph representations of reconstructed neuron meshes from electron-microscopy.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Trained GNNs to classify synapse types and infer connectivity motifs.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Published an open-source toolkit in the NeuroTools suite, adopted by 12 labs worldwide.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"project\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <h3>CellMap: Multi-Modal Single-Cell Atlas</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <div class=\"role\">Co-Principal Investigator</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Developed a Nextflow workflow combining scRNA-Seq, ATAC-Seq, and spatial FISH data.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Implemented Bayesian clustering to resolve cell-type hierarchies in human cortical organoids.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Presented at the International Conference on Single-Cell Genomics (ICSCG) 2023.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <h2>Teaching &amp; Mentorship</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Undergraduate Course:</strong> &ldquo;Introduction to Computational Neuroscience&rdquo; (Spring 2025)</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Graduate Seminar:</strong> &ldquo;Advanced Machine Learning Methods in Biology&rdquo; (Fall 2024)</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Mentorship:</strong> Supervised 8 Ph.D. students and 12 Master&rsquo;s theses.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <h2>Skills &amp; Tools</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, R, C++</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Frameworks:</strong> PyTorch, TensorFlow, scikit-learn, NetworkX</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Data Tools:</strong> Nextflow, Snakemake, Docker, Kubernetes</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Analysis:</strong> MATLAB, Jupyter, Seurat, Scanpy</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Visualization:</strong> D3.js, Plotly, Matplotlib</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <h2>Contact</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <p class=\"contact\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <strong>Email:</strong> lydia.moreno@riverbend.edu<br>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <strong>Office:</strong> Blakely Hall, Room 312, Riverbend University<br>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <strong>Twitter:</strong> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LydiaNeuroLab\">@LydiaNeuroLab</a><br>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/lydia-moreno\">github.com/lydia-moreno</a>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </p>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   </main>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   <footer>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     &copy; 2025 Dr. Lydia Moreno &middot; Riverbend University School of Biological Sciences\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   </footer>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> </body>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> </html>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
